GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 66(7) the person is guilty of an offence` MEANS
    IF `the person contravenes section 66`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Any person who contravenes this section"
    ELSE NOTHING

-- Subsection (7) states no penalty.  The penalty "for which no penalty is otherwise provided" is in
